                                                "sense_id": "946a1003-52e6-37ab-b3d9-38da08df8e1b",
                                                "text": "Per Talking Points Memo, the PolitiChicks are promoting their new book about this new flavor of \"pro-woman\" feminism, which is a term conservatives have been flinging around for the last few years in pursuit of the elusive female vote that implies that the other kind of feminism is for anti-feminine (or possibly lesbo-sexual) crew cut-havers who want to abolish long hair and nail polish and girly laughter and the general concept of love."
